	(text "IB - PORT CURRENT"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 325.056 19 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "5d81eb72-9ee3-5bef-8fec-cb5904d4cee4")
	)
	(text "READBACK RB1 / RB2 (TO CTRL ON A SPARE LINE)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 355.096 296.36 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "7e4c25fe-cf21-5c6d-81c9-f761798f43d3")
	)
	(text "RB1 = OC1 OR hold high-side output present (100 k / 15 k): at rest RB1 = 1 means a stuck channel 1.\nRB2 = OC2. PV-PORT sums them onto the ID line (board_io); firmware reads RB1 + RB2 against the\nmeasured current in operation and through the proof-test windows at start."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 355.096 362.644 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "8049bf17-9181-537d-820f-e2a628accbd1")
	)
	(text "|IB| > 410 A (band 382-441 A, own REF3030E + 0.1 % network, CM-cancelling) AND FB = closed AND\nDIAG = valid -> HOLD2. Test injection 86.6 k from B_TST_T2A (side A) / B_TST_T2B (side B): shifts the threshold\nby 459 A, so a healthy side trips at 0 A under TEST only."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 14 283.86 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "8459ba74-dce1-5d81-a9e3-233f68586e69")
	)
	(text "100 k / 15 k -> Schmitt buffer T (ch1 side A). T -> 47 k / 22 uF -> T_d (ch1 side B). One-shots\n(3.3 uF / 47 k) of T -> T2A (ch2 side A) and of T_d -> T2B (ch2 side B). No single fault trips both\nchannels for longer than one one-shot. Firmware runs it at every start, contactor open and closed\n(report sec. 7.4: windows, what it finds and what it does not)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 14 370.12 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "a43a7b81-96c5-5246-9bcd-8fb0f953370e")
	)
	(text "HOLD-CLOSED LOGIC, CHANNEL 1 (IRFR9214 HIGH SIDE)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 14 117.44 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "ab18de0a-1527-5381-a441-2f7f3c2d153b")
	)
	(text "PROOF-TEST INJECTION (DO_SPARE = TEST)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 14 296.36 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "bb480a01-563c-5156-aaed-004eb5e2a9ac")
	)
	(text "VBX - TERMINAL-SIDE VOLTAGE"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 169.528 19 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "c7a1c17e-21b2-5585-a47d-34bba9197b06")
	)
	(text "6 x TNPV1206 1.00 M (167 V each at 1000 V) + 4.99 k: 1 V = 1203 V, clip 1504 V. 4.7 nF: lag\n<= 27 us incl. AMC3330. Out: VBX_P/N (+/-2 V on 1.44 V, PORT contract). HGND = P2_BUS-."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 169.528 104.94 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
